{
  "slug": "just-keep-swimming",
  "name": "Just Keep Swimming",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Stop losing context. JKS automatically captures everything your agent knows before compression hits - and restores it perfectly and autonomously in the next session. JUST KEEP SWIMMING!",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command**, `justkeepswimming`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install just-keep-swimming@claude-community` from `cyber-qais/justkeepswimming`.\n\nBig plans go badly for AI agents in a predictable way. The agent executes phases one at a time even when they're independent. It spends its own context reading source files until the important early decisions get compressed into mush. When the session dies, the next one starts by re-reading a pile of handoff notes that grows every day. You…",
